      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "5-TAB SIDEBAR LAYOUT  (rocky view \u2192 localhost)\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n#dashboard  \u2192  Rocky IQ banner \u00b7 due-for-review \u00b7 domain health bars\n               recently added nodes \u00b7 projects mini-list\n\n#map        \u2192  PixiJS WebGL force-directed graph\n               nodes coloured by R \u00b7 planning mode toggle\n\n#queue      \u2192  sortable table (recall/recent/reviews/alpha)\n               filter: all/due/critical \u00b7 'Quiz top 5' button\n\n#sessions   \u2192  timeline grouped by created_at date\n               encounter_count \u00d7N badges\n\n#projects   \u2192  chord diagram \u00b7 domain-mix donut \u00b7 knowledge timeline",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "efqjg02u",
      "originalText": "5-TAB SIDEBAR LAYOUT  (rocky view \u2192 localhost)\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n#dashboard  \u2192  Rocky IQ banner \u00b7 due-for-review \u00b7 domain health bars\n               recently added nodes \u00b7 projects mini-list\n\n#map        \u2192  PixiJS WebGL force-directed graph\n               nodes coloured by R \u00b7 planning mode toggle\n\n#queue      \u2192  sortable table (recall/recent/reviews/alpha)\n               filter: all/due/critical \u00b7 'Quiz top 5' button\n\n#sessions   \u2192  timeline grouped by created_at date\n               encounter_count \u00d7N badges\n\n#projects   \u2192  chord diagram \u00b7 domain-mix donut \u00b7 knowledge timeline",
      "lineHeight": 1.4
    },
