      "text": "\ud83d\udcdd ANNOTATION \u2014 open questions:\n\n\u2022 Should Rocky IQ be per-project or global?\n\n\u2022 Is 60-day recency window the right cutoff?\n  (older topics don't affect IQ score)\n\n\u2022 Should Dashboard show a review streak counter?\n\n\u2022 Should Review Queue support bulk-quiz\n  (select multiple topics, run as one session)?\n\n\u2022 Should the Knowledge Map have a search/filter bar?\n\n\u2022 Should Projects tab show per-project Rocky IQ?",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "gfliji18",
      "originalText": "\ud83d\udcdd ANNOTATION \u2014 open questions:\n\n\u2022 Should Rocky IQ be per-project or global?\n\n\u2022 Is 60-day recency window the right cutoff?\n  (older topics don't affect IQ score)\n\n\u2022 Should Dashboard show a review streak counter?\n\n\u2022 Should Review Queue support bulk-quiz\n  (select multiple topics, run as one session)?\n\n\u2022 Should the Knowledge Map have a search/filter bar?\n\n\u2022 Should Projects tab show per-project Rocky IQ?",
